---
layout: base.njk
title: 文獻筆記
description: 每天讀一篇學術論文，整理成 12 段式長摘要與讀書帳圖卡。主題涵蓋生成式 AI、人機協作、管理、教育、行銷與觀光。
permalink: /notes/
---
{%- set cats = collections.notes | catCounts %}
<section class="page-head">
  <h1>文獻筆記</h1>
  <p class="lead">每天讀一篇論文，整理成重點摘要和一張讀書帳。目前共 {{ collections.notes.length }} 篇，多半圍繞生成式 AI 如何改變工作、學習與消費。<a href="/papers/">我自己的學術著作 →</a></p>
  <div class="filters" data-filter-group="noteList">
    <button type="button" data-value="" aria-pressed="true">全部 {{ collections.notes.length }}</button>
    {%- for c in cats %}<button type="button" data-value="{{ c[0] }}" aria-pressed="false">{{ c[0] }} {{ c[1] }}</button>{% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
<ol class="entries list-page paged" id="noteList">
  {%- for n in collections.notes %}
  <li class="entry" data-tag="{{ n.data.category }}">
    <time datetime="{{ n.date | isoDate }}">{{ n.date | ymd }}</time>
    <div>
      <p class="kind">{{ n.data.category }}・{{ n.data.journal | journalName | truncate(48) }}</p>
      <h3><a href="{{ n.url }}">{{ n.data.title }}</a></h3>
      <p class="summary">{{ n.data.summary }}</p>
    </div>
  </li>
  {%- endfor %}
</ol>
<p class="list-page more-wrap"><button type="button" class="btn ghost" id="more">顯示更多</button></p>
<script>
  // 一次先顯示 20 篇；篩選時重新計算
  (function () {
    var list = document.getElementById("noteList"), more = document.getElementById("more"), shown = 20;
    function apply() {
      var vis = [].filter.call(list.children, function (li) { return !li.hidden; }), k = 0;
      vis.forEach(function (li) { li.classList.toggle("over", ++k > shown); });
      more.parentNode.hidden = vis.length <= shown;
    }
    more.onclick = function () { shown += 30; apply(); };
    document.querySelector("[data-filter-group=noteList]").addEventListener("click", function () { shown = 20; setTimeout(apply, 0); });
    apply();
  })();
</script>
